OL,3,GNEWSANew rooftop bar plan to boost art
OL,4,Agallery
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Hull art gallery has submitted plans
OL,7,Ffor a transformation to help improve
OL,8,Faccessibility and attract more
OL,9,Fvisitors.
OL,11,FHumber Street Gallery, which opened in
OL,12,F2017, has submitted plans for a new
OL,13,Flift, expanded rooftop bar area and
OL,14,Fchanges to its frontage.
OL,16,FThe gallery's exhibition, office and
OL,17,Fworkshop spaces will also be updated in
OL,18,Fthe plans submitted to Hull City
OL,19,FCouncil.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,384,380,200,160,0,100
