OL,3,GNEWSANew rooftop bar plan to boost art
OL,4,Agallery
OL,5,
OL,6,FDave McLeavy, CEO of the gallery, said:
OL,7,F"Ultimately we want this development to
OL,8,Fmake the gallery more welcoming to
OL,9,Feveryone."
